{{root|en|ine-pro|*gʰedʰ-}}
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:togedere|tree=+}}
From Late {{inh|en|enm|together}}, from earlier {{m|enm|togedere}}, {{m|enm|togadere}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tōgædere|t=together}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*tōgadura}}, {{m|gmw-pro|*tegadura}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*tō|t=to}} + {{m|gem-pro|*gadar|t=together}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*gʰedʰ-|t=to unite, keep}}, equivalent to {{af|en|to-#Etymology_2|gather|alt1=''to-''<sub>2</sub>}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|thegither|t=together}}, {{cog|ofs|togadera}} (whence {{cog|fy|togearre|t=together}}), {{cog|nl|tegader|t=together}}, {{cog|gml|tōgāder|t=together}}, {{cog|gmh|zegater|t=together}}. Compare also {{cog|ang|ætgædere|t=together}}, {{cog|ang|ġeador|t=together}}. More at {{l|en|gather}}.

